      "  X_predict[0].shape:       (5, 64)  (T_predict, W²)\n",
      "    Class  0 (ACC            ): 5099 samples\n",
      "    Class  1 (PLA            ): 1355 samples\n",
      "    Class  2 (ROC            ): 1878 samples\n",
      "    Class  3 (HAG            ): 110 samples\n",
      "    Class  4 (ABL            ): 3793 samples\n",
      "    Class  5 (ICA            ): 251 samples\n",
      "    Class  6 (LAC            ): 163 samples\n",
      "    Class  7 (FOR            ): 5376 samples\n",
      "Train: 18025 series, Test: 18025 series\n",
